WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.300
- I heard that you were the one

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:03.420
that talked him out of his jitters

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:05.067
when you and Whitney were getting married.

00:00:05.067 --> 00:00:05.970
Was that true?

00:00:05.970 --> 00:00:06.803
- [Alicia] Yes. Yes, yes.

00:00:06.803 --> 00:00:07.727
- [Bobby] Yes, she was at the wedding.

00:00:07.727 --> 00:00:09.610
- How full circle is that?

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:10.780
- I know.

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:13.810
- Yeah. So wait, so you were,
everyone's nervous right?

00:00:13.810 --> 00:00:14.666
When you're about to get married?

00:00:14.666 --> 00:00:16.092
- That's what I say. Everyone's nervous!

00:00:16.092 --> 00:00:19.020
- I was extra nervous.

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:20.060
- It's a terrifying kind of thing.

00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:21.812
That you're like, it's a big step.

00:00:21.812 --> 00:00:22.645
- It's a big deal.

00:00:22.645 --> 00:00:23.670
It's a big step in your life, yeah.

00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:26.200
- I just love that you
were like, you got this,

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:28.760
and then y'all end up married years later.

00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:30.290
- Yeah isn't that crazy? I know.

00:00:30.290 --> 00:00:33.451
I know, it's amazing. It's
the timing of everything

00:00:33.451 --> 00:00:35.200
and why things are meant to be.

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:37.070
But for sure, I was there.

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:40.260
I was a friend and by
then all of his groomsmen

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:42.410
and his brother could not
get him out the bathroom.

00:00:42.410 --> 00:00:44.270
So, I was like, listen,

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:45.990
we are getting this show on the road.

00:00:45.990 --> 00:00:49.300
You know, we're here and this
is happening, and you know.

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:50.420
- Oh, they couldn't get
you out of the room?

00:00:50.420 --> 00:00:52.375
Like, you had serious jitters?

00:00:52.375 --> 00:00:54.450
- I had real, that's what
I was telling you Kelly.

00:00:54.450 --> 00:00:55.690
- Okay, my God. I thought
you meant just, you know,

00:00:55.690 --> 00:00:56.540
like everybody's like.

00:00:56.540 --> 00:00:58.154
- No, I locked myself in

00:00:58.154 --> 00:00:59.192
- (in unison) The bathroom.

00:00:59.192 --> 00:01:00.620
- Oh my God!

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:02.000
Okay, okay.
- [Bobby] Yes!

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:03.199
- [Alicia] So it was fun for us.

00:01:03.199 --> 00:01:04.032
- And I wouldn't come out.

00:01:04.032 --> 00:01:05.440
I wasn't gonna come out for anybody.

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:07.260
- Did she know about this?

00:01:07.260 --> 00:01:09.070
- I think everybody knew about it.

00:01:09.070 --> 00:01:10.860
- Oh my gosh, that's terrifying.

00:01:10.860 --> 00:01:11.914
So you're the one that ended up?

00:01:11.914 --> 00:01:13.903
- She was like, he better
get out that bathroom.

00:01:15.380 --> 00:01:17.850
But for some reason,
yeah, I came to the door,

00:01:17.850 --> 00:01:20.210
I knocked on it, and I was
talking to him through the door

00:01:20.210 --> 00:01:22.840
and then finally he like
peaked it a little bit.

00:01:22.840 --> 00:01:24.270
And I got in, you know,

00:01:24.270 --> 00:01:25.683
and it was like, let me in, let me in,

00:01:25.683 --> 00:01:27.100
everything's gonna be okay.

00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:30.280
And for some reason, you
know, he listens to me

00:01:31.836 --> 00:01:33.920
and he eventually came out the bathroom

00:01:33.920 --> 00:01:35.090
and went down that aisle, yeah,

00:01:35.090 --> 00:01:38.810
but it is ironic that it
was us again meeting in life

00:01:38.810 --> 00:01:40.424
later on and he would be my husband.

00:01:40.424 --> 00:01:43.480
- That's so crazy. I love that.

00:01:43.480 --> 00:01:47.030
It's like a really interesting,
cool romantic comedy.

00:01:47.030 --> 00:01:48.481
I would watch that movie.

00:01:48.481 --> 00:01:49.973
And you were in it.

